# Sentinel option 2 targets, installed as /etc/sentinel/targets with mode 0600.
# One target per line. Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored;
# there are no trailing comments, because # may be part of a regex.
#
#   service <unit>     systemd service; ".service" is added when omitted.
#                      Fails unless ActiveState=active. A failed unit is
#                      restarted when auto-recovery is on.
#   process <name>     exact process name, compared with /proc/<pid>/comm or
#                      the basename of argv[0]. Fails when nothing matches.
#   cmdline <regex>    regex searched in the full command line, for scripts
#                      whose process name is only python3 or node.
#
# Validate after editing: sudo /usr/local/sbin/sentinel check-config
#
# service tailscaled.service
# process caddy
# cmdline ^/usr/bin/python3 /opt/bot/main\.py
